    "failure_condition": "A finite input can select the allocation index of xmlXIncludeNewRef's xmlMalloc within maxAlloc's modulus. The injected allocator returns NULL and sets fuzzAllocFailed. xmlXIncludeErrMemory reports XML_ERR_NO_MEMORY globally but does not set ctxt->errNo. xmlXIncludeGetLastError returns that unchanged context value, so the existing check aborts.",
